\section{Conclusion}

We investigated parameterized complexity of {\psp} with various structural and natural parameters. The hardness and FPT results that we obtained help establish parameterized complexity of {\psp} with respect to most widely used parameters. We leave open the question if {\psp} is FPT parameterized by the feedback edge number of the input graph.

